Button4, Primary    {ALT 5}  ~Shield Setting
Button4, Secondary  {5}  ~Shield On/Off
Button5, Primary    {Z}  ~Step left
Button5, Secondary  {Z}  ~Step left
Button6, Primary    {V}  ~Look down
Button6, Secondary  {R}  ~Look up
Button7, Primary    {R}  ~Look up
Button7, Secondary  {V}  ~Look down
Button8, Primary    {C}  ~Step right
Button8, Secondary  {C}  ~Step right
Throttle  ABSOLUTE_MODE ~Crouching
